} else {
  // PAP-1898 (QA PAP-1901 endorsed cheap fix): a bare bc-consensus count
  // whose purity would surface at confidence 0 is a silhouette-patch
  // artifact, not a measurement (b153 36T: rivet/spoke patch → "11" at
